stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Uninitialized
    Uninitialized --> CreationLease: acquire operation lease
    CreationLease --> Uninitialized: crash before owner write
    CreationLease --> Legacy: old owner commit
    CreationLease --> Compact: new owner commit
    Compact --> Compact: older executor refuses
    Legacy --> Journal: plan add [lease held]
    Compact --> Journal: plan add [lease held]
    Journal --> ProviderRow: commit provider mounts
    ProviderRow --> OwnerRow: commit owner share
    OwnerRow --> Legacy: clear legacy journal
    OwnerRow --> Compact: clear compact journal
    Journal --> Journal: crash and reacquire lease
    ProviderRow --> ProviderRow: crash and reacquire lease
    OwnerRow --> OwnerRow: crash and reacquire lease
